The Poisson Distribution --- a distribution a a function
\layout Itemize

First published by 
\series bold 
Sim\i \'{e}
on Denis Poisson
\series default 
 (1781-1840) in 1837.
 
\layout Itemize

Defined over the space of all non-negative integers.
 
\layout Itemize

