Markov Chain Monopoly
\layout Itemize

Player's state, 
\begin_inset Formula $N(t)$
\end_inset 

, square number +40
\begin_inset Formula $\times$
\end_inset 

number of `GO's
\begin_deeper 
\layout Standard

Normally move through two six sided dice and adding them together.
 Denote the result of this die roll 
