\layout ShortFoilhead

The Queue
\layout Itemize

For arrival rate 
\begin_inset Formula $\lambda$
\end_inset 

, and 
\begin_inset Formula $\bar{N}_{Q}$
\end_inset 

, the average number in queue, and 
\begin_inset Formula $\bar{W}$
\end_inset 

, the average queueing (waiting) time.
\begin_inset Formula \[
\bar{N}_{Q}=\lambda\bar{W}\]

\end_inset 


\layout Itemize

For the 
\begin_inset Formula $M/M/1$
\end_inset 

 queue 
\begin_inset Formula \[
\bar{T}=\bar{X}+\bar{W}=\frac{1}{\mu}+\bar{W}\]

\end_inset 

 so the average time spent waiting in the queue is given by
\begin_inset Formula \[
\bar{W}=\bar{T}-\frac{1}{\mu}=\frac{\rho}{\mu-\lambda}.\]

\end_inset 


\layout Itemize

Average number in the queue is then
\begin_inset Formula \[
\bar{N}_{Q}=\frac{\rho^{2}}{1-\rho}.\]

\end_inset 

 
